Rule 1 (torch.linalg.lstsq API parameters constraints)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 2 ∧ dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2) ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 2)
>>
Rule 2 (driver parameter constraints)
{v_1 : str} |= v_1 = "gels" ∨ v_1 = "gelsy" ∨ v_1 = "gelsd" ∨ v_1 = "gelss" ∨ v_1 = "none"
>>
Rule 3 (rcond parameter constraints)
{v_1 : float} |= v_1 > 0
>>
Rule 4 (A and B have same number of dimensions if they are greater than or equal to 2)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 2 then ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)
>>
Rule 5 (Last two dimensions of A and B shapes must respect least squares constraints)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 2)
>>
Rule 6 (If A and B have the same number of dimensions, and at least 2, the batch dimensions must match)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 3] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i))
>>
Rule 7 (A and B must have floating point or complex dtypes)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10) ∧ (dtype_(v_2) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 10)
>>
Rule 8 (The last dimension of A must be greater than or equal to the second to last dimension of A)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) ≤ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1)
>>
Rule 9 (If rcond is not None, it must be a float)
{v_1 : float ⊎ str} |= if v_1 ≠ "none" then true
>>
Rule 10 (If last two dimensions of A are m and n, last dimension of B is k, then n <= k)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) ≤ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1)
>>
Rule 11 (Last two dimensions of A and B shapes must respect least squares constraints and A must be full rank. This is a CUDA restriction.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : str} |= (ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 2) ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) -1)) ∨ v_3 ≠ "gels"
